<title>GREECE: ATHENS BOURSE APPROVES FOLLIE-FOLLIE IPO.</title>
<headline>ATHENS BOURSE APPROVES FOLLIE-FOLLIE IPO.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Athens stock exchange cleared the initial public offering prospectus of jewelry firm Follie-Follie SA for listing on its small-cap parallel market.</p>
<p>Follie-Follie, which produces and retails jewels and watches, will issue 555,000 common bearer shares of which 26,000 will be privately placed, the bourse said. --Angelos Kiosklis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
